  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the OPTIONS request only returns the header advertising external content if you request it on an object that is a binary resource. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to make sure that containers advertise that external content can be created on the server, when an OPTIONS request is made. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
